# Line endings are LF in the repository, on every platform.
#
# docs/ is synced by a script that runs both locally (Windows, where git's
# autocrlf would otherwise hand it CRLF) and in CI (Linux, LF). Without this,
# the two produce byte-different copies of identical content and every sync
# rewrites all 21 files — a diff that hides the real change inside it.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets git must never touch.
*.png binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
